{"about_the_game":"Wake up in the cave,<br />\r\nNo hands or feet,<br />\r\nNo eyes or ears,<br />\r\nUse all the energy to move forward,<br />\r\nEven abyss and walls can not stop steps.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGo through the dangers,<br />\r\nNo weapons,<br />\r\nNo defense,<br />\r\nBravely face the obstacle in front,<br />\r\nWhole body scars are heroic medals.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLonely silence wander,<br />\r\nSometimes hesitate,<br />\r\nSometimes hover around,<br />\r\nStill believe the way is just in front,<br />\r\nUnknown world is waiting for me to visit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControl Tips:<br />\r\n1.You can only control the white cube to jump left or right, the height and length depends on press time.<br />\r\n2.There is no way to attack, defense or double jump.<br />\r\n3.Jump based on physics, force could be add or reduce.<br />\r\n4.Traps and creatures will hurt each other sometimes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-50 levels<br />\r\n-15 achievement","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"1e0b3adc27565ba7bda0bdfc85b7cb29db5505ab.jpg","localized_name":"Open the door","name":"Open the door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/672080/1e0b3adc27565ba7bda0bdfc85b7cb29db5505ab.jpg"},{"icon":"622930436aa5ab69e2a6bbf69bec1da4b2f51bd4.jpg","localized_name":"Escape from the cave","name":"Escape from the cave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/672080/622930436aa5ab69e2a6bbf69bec1da4b2f51bd4.jpg"},{"icon":"87fe2330eee4437d463788775d98b43f7c971c43.jpg","localized_name":"Secret basement","name":"Secret basement","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/672080/87fe2330eee4437d463788775d98b43f7c971c43.jpg"},{"icon":"13193f6dda280e9112f4e31d708ed6c007c73c46.jpg","localized_name":"Arrive the end","name":"Arrive the end","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/672080/13193f6dda280e9112f4e31d708ed6c007c73c46.jpg"},{"icon":"89002204cb22